# stale-skill: a skill stamped with another necro version
spec: Finders
args: agent-files stale-skill
-- .agents/skills/old/SKILL.md --
---
name: old
description: x
metadata:
  necro-version: "0.0.1"
---
-- .agents/skills/mine/SKILL.md --
---
name: mine
description: x
---
-- @stdout --
.agents/skills/old/SKILL.md:5:1: from necro 0.0.1; this is necro <version>
